Digital asset investment products see record net inflows
🔥 Major data released! According to reports from Wu Shuo, CoinShares' latest statistics show that last week, digital asset investment products experienced a significant influx of funds, with a weekly net inflow of $716 million! This has boosted the industry's assets under management to successfully climb to $180 billion, and market fund enthusiasm continues to heat up.
In terms of fund flow, mainstream crypto assets have become the core money-making force, with the specific inflow situation as follows:
✅ Bitcoin: Strongly attracted $522 million in fund inflows, firmly holding the top position in attracting funds, demonstrating strong market consensus;
✅ Ethereum: Following closely, recorded a net inflow of $337 million, with ecological value gaining funding recognition;
✅ XRP: Shining performance, inflow scale reached $245 million, becoming one of the popular fund-raising assets this week;
✅ Chainlink: Also gained funding favor, with a net inflow of $52.8 million, niche quality assets are gradually gaining attention.
